# Enterprise Platform — Code Owners
#
# Each line maps a file pattern to one or more owners.
# Owners are auto-requested for review when a PR touches matching paths.
#
# When this repo moves to an org, replace @dtaborda with team handles:
#   @org/frontend, @org/backend, @org/platform
#
# Docs: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# ── Root / fallback ───────────────────────────────────────────────
*                               @dtaborda

# ── Web application (Next.js) ────────────────────────────────────
/ui/                            @dtaborda

# ── Packages ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/packages/core/                 @dtaborda
/packages/db/                   @dtaborda
/packages/contracts/            @dtaborda
/packages/ui/                   @dtaborda

# ── AI Skills ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/skills/                        @dtaborda

# ── Platform / CI / Infra ────────────────────────────────────────
/.github/                       @dtaborda
**/Dockerfile*                  @dtaborda
**/docker-compose*.yml          @dtaborda

# ── Documentation ────────────────────────────────────────────────
/docs/                          @dtaborda

# ── Database migrations ──────────────────────────────────────────
/supabase/migrations/           @dtaborda
